<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Technical Support</span></h1>
<hr class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When you have a question about this product, please look first in the User Guides.</span></p>
<h2><span lang="EN-GB">When you have a question</span></h2>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If you cannot find the answer in the User guides, telephone your Metris' Partner Company in your area. Metris fully trains its partners and they should be able to give you immediate technical support.</span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<h2><span lang="EN-GB">Calling a Metris partner company</span></h2>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When you call you should be at your computer and have the Manuals at hand. Be prepared to give the following information:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">the product version number</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">the type of computer you are using</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">the operating system that you are using</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">the exact wording of any messages that appeared on your screen</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">a description of what happened and what you were doing when the problem occurred</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">a description of how you tried to solve the problem</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">For details of your local Marketing Partner, see "Contact Us" area of our <a href="http://www.metris.com">website</a></span></p>
